{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"KICKOFF /rebar-implement on epic e369-a449-4773-48fb (adroit-deductible-kakapo) — Jira Server/DC support via a Jira-family seam.\nTREE: 8 story children, depth 1, no interior tickets. Topological order:\n  J1 acb2 (characterization oracles) -> J2 62d9 (extract jira_family layer) -> {J3 aac8 (RichTextCodec), J4 0a94 (UserIdentityModel)}\n  J5 c97f (Dockerized Jira harness) -> J6 9fd4 (DC transport on pycontribs/jira; also needs J4)\n  {J3, J6} -> J7 b4e3 (assemble JiraDataCenterBackend + contract suite) -> J8 8c35 (ADR)\n  Code leaves: J1..J7. Non-code leaf: J8 (ADR doc).\nENV: worktree /Users/joeoakhart/rebar-jira-family, branch jira-family-seam @ origin/main 1bed2f0cd. Own .venv provisioned; rebar/ruff/mypy/pytest resolve to it. Gerrit commit-msg hook installed.\nLANDING METHOD: rebar/Gerrit default per AGENTS.md — stacked changes via 'git push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main', each commit carrying 'rebar-ticket: <id>' + DCO sign-off + Change-Id; gates = LLM-Review +1 AND Verified +1; land by submitting the top of the stack.\nGATES: rebar.toml confirms require_plan_review_for_claim=true, require_plan_review_for_close=true, completion-verifier close gate on. Verify commands: none pinned per-ticket -> project default 'make lint && make typecheck && make test'. Module-size hard cap 800 LOC (.github/module-size-limit.txt).\nTIERING: orchestrator (strong) owns oracle authoring + held-out validation + landing; implementer subagents dispatched at standard tier by default."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785287435610260001,"uuid":"b3d714a3-b96b-4351-8def-89f975d65a9e"}